Package: cam-settings-tools
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-flask, python3-opencv, python3-numpy, v4l-utils, gstreamer1.0-tools, libcamera-tools
Maintainer: System AE Team <dev@modalix.local>
Description: MODALIX Camera Control PRO - Web-based ISP control tool
 Browser-based UI served at http://<device-ip>:5000 for tuning the
 SiMa.ai Modalix ISP (white balance, exposure, gain, sharpening, noise
 reduction, tone mapping, antiflicker) via v4l2-ctl, with a real-time
 MJPEG live view, presets, per-camera capability detection, and system
 restart integration.
 .
 Requires a SiMa.ai Modalix device with the vendor ISP/libcamera
 pipeline handler already provisioned (i.e. another Modalix board) -
 the ISP controls this tool exposes are vendor-specific and are not
 present on generic Linux/V4L2 hardware.
